@startuml
title AI 2 - RESIDENT FACILITY DISCOVERY AND SPEECH
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam titleFontSize 19
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
skinparam ParticipantPadding 12
hide footbox
autonumber
actor Resident
boundary "FacilityRecommendationController" as API
control FacilityRecommendations as Service
participant "IFacilityGuideSource\n(PropertyAssets)" as Source
control FacilityNeedMatcher as Matcher
participant GeminiFacilityNeedAdvisor as Gemini
database AiRecommendationDbContext as DB
control FacilitySpeech as Speech
participant GeminiFacilitySpeech as TTS

note over Resident, API
  Client plays a static Vietnamese greeting, without waiting for TTS.
  Input is text or browser Vietnamese speech recognition; microphone requires user action.
  Client retains supplemental conversation context, up to 1,200 characters.
end note
Resident -> API : POST facility-recommendations {need, preferredDate}
API -> Service : RecommendAsync(actor, request, ct)
Service -> Service : Check active resident, request limits and building-local date/time
Service -> Matcher : Redact; Interpret; Clarification; Date
alt Intent unclear
  Service --> API : CLARIFY; Suggestions=[]; FollowUp question
else Initial intent understood
  Service -> Source : ReadAsync(ct)
  Source --> Service : Published guides + fingerprint
  alt Child-related request without age
    Service --> API : CLARIFY for age and accompaniment
  else Sufficient information to search
    Service -> Matcher : Match(window, intent, need, date, localNow)
    Matcher --> Service : Eligible candidates and valid opening times
    opt No result for a specified date/time
      Service -> Matcher : Search next valid dates/times
      Matcher --> Service : Alternative schedule, or no candidates
    end
    alt No candidates
      Service --> API : NO_MATCH; no fabricated facility
    else Advisor not ready
      Service --> API : CATALOGUE: explicitly labeled keyword lookup
    else Advisor ready
      Service -> DB : Check per-user fingerprint cache, quota and duplicate in-flight request
      alt Cache hit
        DB --> Service : Cached FacilityRecommendationView
        Service --> API : Cached view
      else Quota exceeded / request already in progress
        Service --> API : 429
      else New permitted AI call
        Service -> DB : Create FacilityRecommendationRun; Commit
        Service -> Gemini : RecommendAsync(redactedNeed, candidateChoices, ct)
        note over Service, Gemini : No open transaction during provider call.\nNo resident/apartment IDs, staff names or contact details sent to the model.
        Gemini --> Service : Up to 3 candidate keys + flags + clarification code / null
        Service -> Service : Validate candidate keys and clarification code
        Service -> Matcher : Recheck eligibility; question only for missing information
        alt AI asks for genuinely missing information
          Service -> Service : Build CLARIFY with a server-controlled question
        else Valid selection
          Service -> Service : Build cards from guide facts; prioritize open/next opening
        else AI failure, invalid key or repeated question
          Service -> Service : Explicit FALLBACK keyword lookup
        end
        Service -> Source : Re-read guide fingerprint
        Service -> Service : Recheck active residence and current local time
        alt Source/time eligibility changed or resident no longer active
          Service -> DB : Complete run without cached response
          Service --> API : 409 / 403; discard stale result
        else Still valid
          Service -> DB : Complete run with result JSON, model and token counts
          Service --> API : FacilityRecommendationView
        end
      end
    end
  end
end

alt A successful view exists (including CLARIFY / NO_MATCH)
  API -> Speech : Prepare(actor, view)
  Speech --> API : Actor-bound SpeechId, valid 10 minutes
  API --> Resident : Display view + SpeechId immediately
  opt Resident has sound enabled or requests replay
    Resident -> API : POST facility-recommendations/speech {speechId}
    API -> Service : CatalogueAsync(actor, ct): recheck residence
    API -> Speech : GetAsync(actor, input, ct)
    Speech -> Speech : Validate ticket ownership/expiry; check audio cache and quota
    alt Audio cached
      Speech --> API : Cached WAV base64
    else Generation allowed
      Speech -> TTS : GenerateAsync(server-created transcript, ct)
      TTS --> Speech : WAV / provider failure
      Speech --> API : Audio, or 503 if unavailable
    else Invalid ticket / quota exceeded
      Speech --> API : 404 / 429
    end
    API --> Resident : Play audio, or show replay option while retaining text
    note over Resident, Speech : Audio failure does not switch off the user's sound preference.\nTTS receives no arbitrary client text, resident query or private contacts.
  end
else Request rejected
  API --> Resident : ProblemDetails; allow correction/retry
end
note over Resident, API : Follow-up replies repeat this flow with accumulated context.\nSuggestions do not reserve places or confirm childcare acceptance.
@enduml

